# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:17
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<acronym>ldap</acronym> is the lightweight directory access protocol. It "
"provides access to an X.500 directory, or to a stand-alone "
"<acronym>LDAP</acronym> server."
msgstr ""
"<acronym>ldap</acronym> इति लघुनिर्देशिकाप्रवेशप्रोटोकॉलः । एतत् X.500 "
"निर्देशिकायाः, अथवा एकान्तस्य <acronym>LDAP</acronym> सर्वरस्य प्रवेशं "
"प्रदाति ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:21
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "You can use the ldap KIO worker as follows:"
msgstr "भवान् ldap KIO worker इत्यस्य उपयोगं निम्नलिखितरूपेण कर्तुं शक्नोति ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:23
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<userinput>ldap://host:port/ou=People,o=where,c=de??sub</userinput> for a "
"subtree-query"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>ldap://host:port/ou=उपवृक्ष-प्रश्नस्य कृते "
"जनाः,o=where,c=de??sub</userinput>"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:26
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"or "
"<userinput>ldap://host:port/cn=MM,ou=People,o=where,c=de??base</userinput> "
"for a complete branch."
msgstr ""
"अथवा "
"<userinput>ldap://host:port/cn=MM,ou=People,o=where,c=de??base</userinput> "
"पूर्णशाखायाः कृते ।"